000;border-top:1pt solid #000000;padding:1.5pt 1pt 1.5pt 0;text-align:right;vertical-align:bottom"/&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;/table&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Arial',sans-serif;font-size:9pt;font-weight:700;line-height:120%"&gt;Borrowings from PHI intercompany money pool &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;br/&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style="text-align:justify"&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Arial',sans-serif;font-size:9pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%"&gt;To provide an additional short-term borrowing option that will generally be more favorable to the borrowing participants than the cost of external financing, PHI operates an intercompany money pool that Pepco participates in.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;</ferc:DisclosureOfApplicableNotesTextBlock>
